  "description": "Hae-Gyeong, a rabbit shifter, has spent years pining for the golden boy of the neighborhood, Jae-Hyeon. Everyone loves Jae-Hyeon, but Hae-Gyeong wants to be the only one. One impulsive, drunken night, the lines between them blur when Jae-Hyeon crosses the ultimate boundary, leaving Hae-Gyeong more deeply in love than ever. However, the morning after brings a cold reality: Jae-Hyeon is drawing lines again. Now, Hae-gGeong must see if he can finally break through Jae-Hyun’s walls, or if his true love will remain forever out of reach.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
